tem\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Why choose luxury home interior designs from one firm?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">One team designing and supervising every room keeps the quality and style the same throughout the home.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>Refined Living, Every Day</h2>\n            <p>Luxury is not about showing off; it is about living well. Our luxury home interior designs focus on comfort and quality that last for years.</p><p>Considering a high-end home in Pitampura or Kohat Enclave? <a href=\"/pitampura/contact\">Meet 9th Corner in private</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}